diff --git a/tests/data/test_3mf/qidi_max4_sparse.README.md b/tests/data/test_3mf/qidi_max4_sparse.README.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..b87f5308
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/data/test_3mf/qidi_max4_sparse.README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+The adjacent qidi_max4_sparse.3mf is an offline MAX4 reference project generated
+with official QIDI Studio v2.07.02.73 (source commit
+403b619d56147160bb883e94f95a7951245bc6d0). Profile and G-code content is derived
+from QIDI Studio under AGPL-3.0, the same license as this repository.
+
+It contains a locally generated 10 x 10 x 4 mm cube assigned to logical filament
+3, with two unused leading filament entries. Box temperatures are 35/40/45 C.
+There are no printer addresses, credentials or physical-slot assignments.
+SHA-256: 35e23d6208bcfad4866912d3fa2c9d76c91303a628a9258c02bd5909fcc1acd6
+
+The fixture catches accidental treatment as a generic geometry-only 3MF, loss
+of material assignments, and incompatible QIDI automatic raft expansion/profile
+names. The source QIDI application treats raft_first_layer_expansion=-1 as 2 mm
+in SupportCommon.cpp, in both raft and ordinary support paths.
